# test: server_lifecycle
# description: Explicit server lifecycle commands start idempotently and stop cleanly

## Environment

terminal:
  name: T1

## Test

# Init leaves the installation running; test startup from a stopped state.
@T1
> amux server stop
Server shutting down.

> amux server start
Server started.

@T1
> amux server start
Server already running.

@T1
> amux server stop
Server shutting down.
